<title>USA: KCS Energy Inc raises dividend.</title>
<headline>KCS Energy Inc raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>EDISON, N.J. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.02		     $0.03</p>
<p> Pay		    Aug 20</p>
<p> Record		July 11</p>
<p>NOTE: The prior dividend was before the company's two-for-one stock split that is set to take place on June 30.</p>
<p>The new dividend on a split-adjusted basis increases the payout by 33 percent.</p>
</text>
